internvideo2.py, pos_embed.py, config_bert_large.json and bert/ are taken from the
InternVideo2 code of OpenGVLab (https://github.com/OpenGVLab/InternVideo,
InternVideo2/multi_modality, MC-QA demo variant).

* bert/xbert.py and bert/tokenization_bert.py derive from Hugging Face Transformers
  (Apache-2.0, headers kept) via ALBEF/BLIP (BSD-3-Clause, Salesforce).
* Changes: pretrain_internvideo2_1b_patch14_224() no longer loads a checkpoint
  itself (weights are loaded once by src.features.internvideo2), and the
  flash-attention import warnings were silenced. Model code is otherwise unchanged.

License of the upstream repository: to be confirmed before release (the local
copy used for the research had no LICENSE file).
